OL,3,GNEWSAFirst step for Station Quarter
OL,4,Aproject plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build hundreds of new homes,
OL,7,Fshops and a multi-storey car park next
OL,8,Fto Derby's railway station have taken a
OL,9,Ffirst step in the planning process.
OL,11,FA "screening opinion" has been
OL,12,Fsubmitted, which is required to decide
OL,13,Fif an environmental impact assessment
OL,14,Fwould be required as part of a full
OL,15,Fplanning application, ahead of a
OL,16,Fregeneration scheme for Derby's Station
OL,17,FQuarter.
OL,19,FAccording to planning documents,
OL,20,Fchanges are being drawn up for three
OL,21,Fareas around Derby Midland Station in
OL,22,FRailway Terrace.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
